stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> New : QA finds a defect
    New --> Triaged : Severity and priority assigned
    Triaged --> Assigned : Routed to a developer
    Assigned --> Resolved : Developer fixes and marks Resolved
    Resolved --> Retested : QA repeats the original reproduction steps
    Retested --> Closed : Defect confirmed gone, regression suite green
    Retested --> Reopened : Defect still reproduces
    Reopened --> Assigned : Back to the developer
    Closed --> [*]

    note right of Retested
        Regression testing runs alongside
        every retest, confirming the fix
        did not break anything else.
    end note
